  ('dxd-gasper', 'high-school-dxd-opi', 'Gasper Vladi', null, null, null, null, 'Alfil del grupo Gremory · vampiro', null, null, null, false, 'Gasper is an effeminate-looking male with platinum blond hair and pinkish-violet eyes. His hair is styled in short bob cut with several small fringes over his forehead, and he has pointed ears. Kiba describes him as looking like a beautiful girl.

